## Performance Analysis — `DataSize.cs`

Given this is a **hot path** (thousands of concurrent transfers, real-time dashboard), all findings are elevated.

---

### Scan Execution Checklist

| Recipe | Hits |
|--------|------|
| `.Replace(` | 7 |
| `.Contains(` (string search) | 3 |
| `string.Format` / `$"..."` interpolation | 1 |
| `CultureInfo.CurrentCulture` | 3 |
| Redundant recomputation | 2 (`LargestWholeNumber*`) |
| `sealed` keyword | 0 (struct — N/A) |
